  "body": "Want to own in Takapuna for well under half a mil WITH a car park?\r\nYou won't find many opportunities - but boy do we have a brilliant one for you right here.\r\nPriced to be snapped up quickly, but you can still try your luck with any offer.\r\nOne thing's for sure - with the way prices are headed in this location, you'll look back and laugh for how much you bought it for!\r\n \r\nUp high on the 13th floor, it's quiet up here and the views are spectacular.\r\nThe Spencer on Byron is a popular complex with resort style facilities including pool, spa, gym and even a tennis court.\r\nIt's walking distance to Takapuna beach, Shore City shopping and some fantastic bars and restaurants.\r\nPublic transport links a plenty too.\r\n \r\nJames Mairs holds the keys, call now!\r\nSome images may be of a similar unit, ask James for more info.",
